OL,3,GNEWSAMersey ferry out of action for
OL,4,Aseveral more weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Mersey ferry service is due to be out
OL,7,Fof action for several more weeks
OL,8,Fbecause of an "ongoing mechanical
OL,9,Fissue" with its engine.
OL,11,FThe Snowdrop, nicknamed the Dazzle
OL,12,FFerry, has already been out of service
OL,13,Ffor several weeks, and further delays
OL,14,Fmean there will be no services during
OL,15,Fthe half-term holidays.
OL,17,FMersey Ferries said: "Whilst engineers
OL,18,Fare currently working to rectify the
OL,19,Fissue, it is likely the Snowdrop will
OL,20,Fremain out of service for several
OL,21,Fweeks."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
